     A                                      REF(SWMREF)
     A          R EXSPF01
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* Programmstatus
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A            EXSPF0PGSTR               REFFLD(##PGST)
     A            EXSPF0PROGR               REFFLD(##PROG)
     A            EXSPF0FLDNR               REFFLD(##FLDN)
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* ON/OFF KZ für Prüfungen
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A            EXSPF0IFKZR               REFFLD(##IFKZ)
     A            EXSPF0YYKZR               REFFLD(##A001)
     A                                      TEXT('ON/OFF-Feld für Prüfung 2')
     A            EXSPF0FR01R               REFFLD(##FREI)
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* Key-Felder
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A            EXSPF0N020R               REFFLD(SPEDF01/KUN020 *LIBL/SPEDF0)
     A            EXSPF0FR02R  256          REFFLD(##FREI)
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* Kopier-Begriff NACH
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A            EXSPF0NN20R               REFFLD(SPEDF01/KUN020 *LIBL/SPEDF0)
     A            EXSPF0FR03R  256          REFFLD(##FREI)
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A* evt. weitere Felder für Update oder Prüfungen
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A            EXSPF0FR04R  434          REFFLD(##FREI)
